<p>Enjoying a perfect day, with barely a breeze, thousands of area residents attended 1911 Missouri Slope Fair and witnessed an airplane demonstration from the barnstormer Robert St. Henry. Out of the thousands in attendance, not more than 20 had ever before seen an airplane.</p>

